{"number":101,"nameArabic":"القارعة","nameTransliterated":"Al-Qari'ah","nameTranslated":"The Calamity","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":11,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"101:1","textAr":"ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"AlqariAAatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"The Striking Calamity"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"عظیم حادثہ"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"101:2","textAr":"مَا ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Ma alqariAAatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"What is the Striking Calamity"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا ہے وہ عظیم حادثہ؟"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"101:3","textAr":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلۡقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma alqariAAatu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم کیا جانو کہ وہ عظیم حادثہ کیا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"101:4","textAr":"يَوۡمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلۡفَرَاشِ ٱلۡمَبۡثُوثِ","transliteration":"Yawma yakoonu alnnasu kaalfarashi almabthoothi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ دن جب لوگ بکھرے ہوئے پروانوں کی طرح"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"101:5","textAr":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلۡجِبَالُ كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ ٱلۡمَنفُوشِ","transliteration":"Watakoonu aljibalu kaalAAihni almanfooshi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پہاڑ رنگ برنگ کے دھنکے ہوئے اون کی طرح ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"101:6","textAr":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتۡ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Faamma man thaqulat mawazeenuhu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر جس کے پلڑے بھاری ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"101:7","textAr":"فَهُوَ فِي عِيشَةٖ رَّاضِيَةٖ","transliteration":"Fahuwa fee AAeeshatin radiyatin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He will be in a pleasant life"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ دل پسند عیش میں ہوگا"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"101:8","textAr":"وَأَمَّا مَنۡ خَفَّتۡ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Waamma man khaffat mawazeenuhu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But as for one whose scales are light"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جس کے پلڑے ہلکے ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"101:9","textAr":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٞ","transliteration":"Faommuhu hawiyatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"His refuge will be an abyss"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اس کی جائے قرار گہری کھائی ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"101:10","textAr":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهۡ","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma hiyah","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And what can make you know what that is"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تمہیں کیا خبر کہ وہ کیا چیز ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"101:11","textAr":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةُۢ","transliteration":"Narun hamiyatun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It is a Fire, intensely hot"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"بھڑکتی ہوئی آگ"}]}]}